24	
25	## A: Supabase Auth (Acme)
26	
27	Reuse the existing server `userClient` and privileged `adminClient`. Call `auth.getUser()` to verify the token, then query `memberships` by subject, app, and active status. Match the selected tenant only within those rows. Read the session_id claim from the same access token verified by `getUser`, not from an unverified JWT supplied independently. Never use `getSession()` alone as authentication.
